# Test Of Magus (Q228), a second class-change test for wizards, played by a level 39 Human Wizard
# who already holds most of each trophy count (the kills below bring each to its count), every
# script roll pinned to 1 (every drop lands): Rukal starts it and pays the level 39 set's
# Dimensional Diamonds; Parina's letter for Casian, who gives the lilac charm; the three singing
# flowers each give their golden seed once, crying out as they die; Rukal turns the seeds and the
# charm into the score of elements; the elementals of water, fire, wind and earth each give their
# charm, take their trophies for their tone, and the last tone sends the traveller back; Rukal
# takes the score and the four tones for the Mark of Magus; then relog.
# Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q228_test_of_magus.golden
character Magus 39
class 11
random always 1
hold 2848 19
hold 2849 4
hold 2850 19
hold 2851 10
hold 2852 10
hold 2853 9
hold 2854 10
hold 2855 10
script quest.Q228_TestOfMagus
item 2840 2841 2842 2843 2844 2845 2846 2847 2848 2849 2850 2851 2852 2853 2854 2855 2856 2857 2858 2859 2860 2861 2862 2863 7562
